sofa cx = 403.0.\\n# Angle offset: alpha2 = math.atan((403.0 - 255.5) / 256.0) = 29.9 deg.\\n# Total angle in map = 0 + 29.9 = 29.9 deg clockwise from +y.\\n# Ray 2: p2 + t2 * [sin(29.9 deg), cos(29.9 deg)]\\n\\np2 = np.array([0.433, 1.616])\\nth2 = np.radians(0.0 + np.degrees(np.arctan((403.0 - 255.5) / 256.0)))\\nd2 = np.array([np.sin(th2), np.cos(th2)])\\n\\nA = np.column_stack([d1, -d2])\\nt = np.linalg.solve(A, p2 - p1)\\npt = p1 + t[0] * d1\\nprint(f\\\"Sofa intersection: {pt}, t1={t[0]:.3f}, t2={t[1]:.3f}\\\")\\n'\", \"description\": \"Triangulate sofa position\"}"}}]},"dcd0c846272b20da06a18926c297f4a30770f84e2df761c6063b2ee5ee3be9ec":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image_url","image_url":{"url":"/media/e95939c96c8998d1ef3c1ddb4167a21a025506edb315a938cb1857ff8cb02bc5.png"}}]},"dc0e94f7f153abfba5508fb2a5a64530096ecf04636013fe8c6db04da4106a13":{"role":"assistant","content":"The mapping exploration has reached checkpoint 40 (40 frames acquired).\n\nDuring frames 31 to 40, the agent explored the north-west corridor, approached the floor lamp, stool, wooden chair, and blue jug, then turned eastward to view the room interior (plant, cabinet, table, and sofa). All 8 observed objects have been triangulated and validated from multiple vantage points:\n- `floor_lamp_1`: (-2.30, 5.85)\n- `stool_1`: (-0.95, 4.60)\n- `chair_1`: (-2.45, 3.65)\n- `potted_plant_1`: (1.10, 2.75)\n- `table_1`: (2.40, 1.60)\n- `cabinet_1`: (2.10, 3.50)\n- `sofa_1`: (2.80, 5.80)\n- `jug_1`: (-2.48, 1.62)\n\nThe map file has been updated and saved to `/work/map.json` with `stop_reason: \"checkpoint\"`."},"dc4b24c726d08da71f93a1de7347ee2e53360cce3dfcd5a365d74db1de9c553e":{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"toolu_e48be7c6430c4052b0e0afd097a37380","content":"{\"frame\": 43, \"image\": \"/work/observations/obs_0043.png\", \"requested_action\": {\"turn_deg\": -15, \"move_m\": 0.5}, \"status\": \"executed\", \"collision\": false, \"remaining_frames\": 157, \"checkpoint_at\": 60}"},"dcbb7655c90d5529ad02f3